1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,691
先问模型一个问题：这张照片里是哪种奶酪？
Here is a question for a model: what cheese is in this photo?

2
00:00:04,011 --> 00:00:09,323
画面上的两个答案都来自 cli.py 里同一段预测代码
Both answers on screen come from the same predict code in cli.py.

3
00:00:09,643 --> 00:00:11,307
而且两个答案都说是 brie
And both answers say brie.

4
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:13,150
现在数一数这些数字
Now count the numbers.

5
00:00:13,257 --> 00:00:16,115
上面那个是 README 的输出，里面有三个数
The top answer, the README output, holds three.

6
00:00:16,435 --> 00:00:19,145
下面那个来自这次录制，有四个数
The bottom one, from this recording, holds four.

7
00:00:19,465 --> 00:00:21,321
一个模型不可能给出两种结果
One model cannot give both.

8
00:00:21,641 --> 00:00:25,246
那么，endpoint 后面到底是哪个模型，还有些什么？
So which model is behind an endpoint, and what else is there?

9
00:00:25,483 --> 00:00:29,612
在 endpoint 后面有三样东西：一个产物，决定是哪个模型
Behind an endpoint sit three pieces: an artifact, which model;

10
00:00:29,612 --> 00:00:31,344
一个 container，决定用什么跑它
a container, what runs it;

11
00:00:31,344 --> 00:00:34,208
还有一台机器，决定在哪里跑、谁来付钱
and a machine, where it runs, and who pays.

12
00:00:34,528 --> 00:00:38,326
机器旁边的计价器一直在走，哪怕一个请求都没来
The meter beside the machine keeps running while no request arrives.

13
00:00:39,733 --> 00:00:42,805
在第 2 部分，我们不再手动跑这些步骤
In part 2, we stop running these steps by hand.

14
00:00:43,125 --> 00:00:48,267
Cheese App 的四个阶段会变成一条 pipeline，由云端替你运行
The four stages of the Cheese App become one pipeline that the cloud runs for you.

15
00:00:48,517 --> 00:00:54,394
要跟着做，你需要：开通了结算的 AWS 账号、AWS CLI、Docker
To follow along, you need an AWS account with billing, the AWS CLI, Docker,

16
00:00:54,394 --> 00:00:56,666
还要把两个 repo 都 clone 下来
and both repositories cloned.

17
00:00:56,986 --> 00:00:59,631
这是我们第一次讲 AWS
This is our first lecture on AWS.

18
00:00:59,867 --> 00:01:02,701
角落里的进度条标出 README 的哪一步
A tracker in the corner names the README step,

19
00:01:02,701 --> 00:01:05,904
黄色的 your turn 标签表示暂停一下，自己跑一遍
and a yellow tag, your turn, means pause and run it.

20
00:01:06,224 --> 00:01:08,763
每条命令也都写在学习指南里
Every command is also in the study guide.

21
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:11,892
先看这一讲的位置
First, where this lecture sits.

22
00:01:12,212 --> 00:01:14,855
课程项目现在处于原型阶段
The course project is in its prototype phase,

23
00:01:14,855 --> 00:01:18,143
Cheese App 的四个部分里已经做完三个
and of the four parts of the Cheese App, three are done.

24
00:01:18,463 --> 00:01:20,297
模型部署还没做
Model deploy is still open.

25
00:01:20,533 --> 00:01:22,816
这个视频的第 1 部分填上这一格
Part 1 of this video fills that tile.

26
00:01:23,136 --> 00:01:24,864
第 2 部分把四个全部连起来
Part 2 connects all four.

27
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:28,769
上周，第 14 讲把 container 部署到了 Cloud Run 上
Last week, lecture 14 put containers on Cloud Run.

28
00:01:29,089 --> 00:01:31,713
今天，container 对外提供一个训练好的模型
Today, the container serves a trained model.

29
00:01:31,950 --> 00:01:35,044
课上把控制台的各个部分和课程对应起来
The lecture maps its console onto the course:

30
00:01:35,044 --> 00:01:37,520
notebook、第 13 讲的训练
notebooks, training from lecture 13,

31
00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:40,889
还有今天的两项：在线预测和 pipeline
and today's two, online prediction and pipelines.

32
00:01:41,133 --> 00:01:44,674
课上讲的是 Google Cloud 上的 Vertex AI
The lecture is written for Vertex AI on Google Cloud.

33
00:01:44,994 --> 00:01:51,202
这门课也提供了两个教程的 AWS 版本，我们跟的就是它
This course also ships an AWS version of both tutorials, and that is the one we follow.

34
00:01:51,522 --> 00:01:53,442
思路一样，名字不同
Same ideas, different names.

35
00:01:53,762 --> 00:01:55,768
每遇到一个，我都会指出来
I'll point out each one as we meet it.

36
00:01:56,017 --> 00:01:58,342
Google Cloud 的 bucket 变成了 S3
A Google Cloud bucket becomes S3.

37
00:01:58,662 --> 00:02:01,437
服务账号的密钥变成了一个 IAM 用户
A service account key becomes an IAM user

38
00:02:01,437 --> 00:02:04,956
密钥放在你的笔记本上，再加上云端的一个角色
with a key on your laptop, plus a role in the cloud.

39
00:02:05,276 --> 00:02:09,030
而 endpoint 变成了一份配置加上一个 endpoint
And an endpoint becomes a configuration plus an endpoint.

40
00:02:09,267 --> 00:02:13,342
关于这次录制，有一点要说明：录制用的环境没有 AWS 账号
One thing about this recording: it has no AWS account.

41
00:02:13,662 --> 00:02:16,392
在你笔记本上跑的每一步都是真的
Every step that runs on your laptop is real.

42
00:02:16,712 --> 00:02:21,150
每个 AWS 调用，都停在它遇到的第一个真实报错上，就像这个
Every AWS call stops at its honest first error, like this one.

43
00:02:21,470 --> 00:02:23,184
云端本来会回答的地方
Where the cloud would answer,

44
00:02:23,184 --> 00:02:26,376
你看到的是 README 的输出，或者标好的本地替身
you see the README output, or a tagged local stand-in.

45
00:02:26,696 --> 00:02:28,296
绝不假装成功
Never a faked success.

46
00:02:28,467 --> 00:02:31,219
录制时的版本都在画面上
Versions at the time of recording are on screen.

47
00:02:33,367 --> 00:02:35,756
第 1 步：clone 这个 repo
Step 1: clone the repository.

48
00:02:36,076 --> 00:02:38,379
README 写的是 clone 或者下载
The README says clone or download,

49
00:02:38,379 --> 00:02:40,140
所以我们的 git clone 是额外的
so our git clone is extra,

50
00:02:40,140 --> 00:02:43,799
用来显示我们跟的那个 commit 的 git log 也是
and so is the git log that shows the commit we follow.

51
00:02:44,119 --> 00:02:45,567
暂停一下，clone 下来
Pause and clone it.

52
00:02:45,617 --> 00:02:46,930
额外列一下目录
An extra listing:

53
00:02:46,930 --> 00:02:51,102
CLI、一个 Dockerfile、一个 Pipfile、八张示例照片
the CLI, a Dockerfile, a Pipfile, eight sample photos,

54
00:02:51,102 --> 00:02:54,193
还有 docker-shell.sh，已经是可执行的
and docker-shell.sh, already executable.

55
00:02:54,434 --> 00:02:57,591
第 2 步和第 3 步在 AWS 控制台里做
Steps 2 and 3 are in the AWS console.

56
00:02:57,911 --> 00:03:01,474
确认你能用 S3、SageMaker 和 IAM
Check that you can use S3, SageMaker and IAM.

57
00:03:01,794 --> 00:03:06,615
然后创建一个 IAM 用户，叫 model-deployment，挂上三个策略
Then create an IAM user called model-deployment, with three policies.

58
00:03:06,935 --> 00:03:09,154
第三个策略的权限比这段代码需要的更宽
The third is broader than this code needs.

59
00:03:09,474 --> 00:03:11,607
创建访问密钥，两个都存好
Create access keys and save both.

60
00:03:12,150 --> 00:03:16,250
第 4 步创建一个叫 SageMakerExecutionRole 的角色
Step 4 creates a role named SageMakerExecutionRole,

61
00:03:16,250 --> 00:03:20,833
信任 SageMaker，挂上 SageMaker 和 S3 的策略
trusted by SageMaker, with the SageMaker and S3 policies.

62
00:03:21,153 --> 00:03:22,750
复制它的 ARN
Copy its ARN.

63
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,400
为什么要两个身份？
Why two identities?

64
00:03:24,528 --> 00:03:27,779
你的笔记本用用户的密钥给每个请求签名
Your laptop signs each request with the user key,

65
00:03:27,779 --> 00:03:31,163
而你之后创建的 endpoint 以这个角色的身份运行
and the endpoint you create later acts as the role.

66
00:03:31,483 --> 00:03:33,232
密钥只留在你的笔记本上
The key stays on your laptop.

67
00:03:33,467 --> 00:03:37,830
第 5 步，然后暂停：用你自己起的名字建一个 bucket
Step 5, then pause: create a bucket with a name of your own,

68
00:03:37,830 --> 00:03:41,467
因为 bucket 名在整个 AWS 里都是唯一的
because bucket names are unique across all of AWS.

69
00:03:41,787 --> 00:03:44,027
只要里面放着文件，存储就在计费
Storage bills while files sit in it.

70
00:03:44,347 --> 00:03:47,675
而且就像 README 提醒的，永远不要把密钥写进脚本
And as the README warns, never put keys in a script,

71
00:03:47,675 --> 00:03:49,531
也永远不要把它们 commit 到 Git
and never commit them to Git.

72
00:03:49,767 --> 00:03:53,202
Run Container 的第 1 步：aws configure
Run Container, step 1: aws configure.

73
00:03:53,522 --> 00:03:55,122
接着会出现四个提示
Then come four prompts.

74
00:03:55,292 --> 00:03:56,892
你把两个密钥贴进去
You paste your two keys.

75
00:03:57,127 --> 00:04:02,055
我们没有密钥，所以按两次 Enter，再输入 us-east-1 和 json
We have none, so we press Enter twice, then type us-east-1 and json.

76
00:04:02,300 --> 00:04:06,543
两个额外检查：只有 config 文件存在，因为我们没输入密钥
Two extras: only the config file exists, since we typed no keys,

77
00:04:06,543 --> 00:04:10,257
身份查询那一步也找不到凭据
and aws sts get-caller-identity cannot find credentials.

78
00:04:10,577 --> 00:04:12,689
用你的密钥，它会打印出你的账号
With your keys, it prints your account.

79
00:04:13,009 --> 00:04:14,738
暂停一下，让你的也打印出来
Pause and make yours print it.

80
00:04:14,984 --> 00:04:18,781
第 2 步还给了第二个选项：在你的 shell 里做三条 export
Step 2 offers a second option: three exports in your shell.

81
00:04:19,101 --> 00:04:21,853
AWS 拒绝了我们的占位密钥
AWS rejects our placeholder key.

82
00:04:22,100 --> 00:04:23,600
还有一个更隐蔽的疏漏
There is a subtler gap:

83
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:28,265
脚本只把区域、bucket 和角色传进 container
the script passes only the region, the bucket and the role into the container.

84
00:04:28,585 --> 00:04:30,783
所以 export 的密钥到墙那里就掉了
So exported keys fall off at the wall.

85
00:04:31,103 --> 00:04:34,004
用选项 1，或者用 -e 把密钥加进去
Use option 1, or add the keys with -e.

86
00:04:37,333 --> 00:04:40,757
第 3 步：在 docker-shell.sh 里填上你的 bucket
Step 3: edit docker-shell.sh with your bucket,

87
00:04:40,757 --> 00:04:43,584
你那个角色的 ARN 和你的区域
the ARN of your role, and your region.

88
00:04:43,904 --> 00:04:45,504
我们的是占位符
Ours are placeholders.

89
00:04:45,833 --> 00:04:48,308
第 4 步，chmod，什么都不打印
Step 4, chmod, prints nothing.

90
00:04:48,628 --> 00:04:52,404
额外列一下目录，可以看到脚本本来就是可执行的
An extra listing shows the script was already executable.

91
00:04:52,650 --> 00:04:55,530
第 5 步：sh docker-shell.sh
Step 5: sh docker-shell.sh.

92
00:04:55,850 --> 00:04:58,575
它拉取 arm64 的基础 image
It pulls the base image for arm64,

93
00:04:58,575 --> 00:05:02,741
然后停在第一行 RUN 上：exec format error
then stops at the first RUN line: exec format error.

94
00:05:03,061 --> 00:05:06,367
我们这台 Intel 架构的笔记本运行不了那些程序
Our Intel style laptop cannot run those programs.

95
00:05:06,616 --> 00:05:08,216
修复就在脚本里
The fix is in the script.

96
00:05:08,472 --> 00:05:11,150
第 19 行是给 Apple Silicon 的 Mac 用的
Line 19 is for Apple silicon Macs,

97
00:05:11,150 --> 00:05:14,851
第 17 行被注释掉了，是普通的构建
and line 17, commented out, is the plain build.

98
00:05:15,171 --> 00:05:17,197
把两行对调：修复 1，额外的一步
Swap them: fix 1, an extra.

99
00:05:17,517 --> 00:05:20,333
在 Apple Silicon 上，原来那一行没问题
On Apple silicon the original line works.

100
00:05:20,653 --> 00:05:23,555
在别的机器上，它意味着很慢的模拟运行，或者这个报错
Elsewhere it means slow emulation, or this error.

101
00:05:23,816 --> 00:05:25,416
现在看 Pipfile
Now look at the Pipfile.

102
00:05:25,629 --> 00:05:28,083
TensorFlow 被 pin 到一个版本
TensorFlow is pinned to one version,

103
00:05:28,083 --> 00:05:30,536
可 SageMaker 写的是星号：任何版本都行
but SageMaker says "*": any version.

104
00:05:30,856 --> 00:05:34,195
而且没用 lock 文件：Git 忽略了 lock 文件
And no lock is used: Git ignores the lock file,

105
00:05:34,195 --> 00:05:37,747
Dockerfile 在构建时跑 pipenv lock
and the Dockerfile runs pipenv lock at build time.

106
00:05:37,983 --> 00:05:39,583
想一想
Something to ponder.

107
00:05:39,647 --> 00:05:43,060
代码写的时候是能用的，也没人改过一行
The code worked when it was written, and nobody changed a line.

108
00:05:43,380 --> 00:05:46,388
为什么今天 cli.py 在导入时就失败了？
Why does cli.py fail at import today?

109
00:05:55,233 --> 00:05:58,561
星号是约束，不是 pin，和第 1 讲一样
"*" is a constraint, not a pin, as in lecture 1:

110
00:05:58,561 --> 00:06:02,166
解析器会选能装上的最新版本
the resolver takes the newest release that installs.

111
00:06:02,486 --> 00:06:08,833
录制时，在 Python 3.9 上，那就是 SageMaker SDK 版本 3
At the time of recording, on Python 3.9, that is SageMaker SDK version 3,

112
00:06:08,833 --> 00:06:11,788
还带着 PyTorch 和 14 个 CUDA 包
with PyTorch and 14 CUDA packages.

113
00:06:12,033 --> 00:06:17,841
版本 3 是一个重写过的包，缺了 cli.py 导入的那些模块
Version 3 is a rewritten package, without the modules cli.py imports:

114
00:06:17,841 --> 00:06:20,955
没有 tensorflow 模块、serializers
no tensorflow module, no serializers,

115
00:06:20,955 --> 00:06:22,806
也没有 get execution role
no get_execution_role.

116
00:06:23,126 --> 00:06:24,726
导入什么都找不到
The imports find nothing.

117
00:06:24,883 --> 00:06:28,915
在这里，没 pin 的构建跑了 13 分钟，然后磁盘满了
Here, the unpinned build ran 13 minutes, then ran out of disk.

118
00:06:29,235 --> 00:06:33,032
在你的笔记本上它会构建完成，然后在第一次导入时失败
On your laptop it would finish, then fail at the first import.

119
00:06:33,266 --> 00:06:36,999
修复 2，也是额外的：把星号改成小于 3
Fix 2, also an extra: change "*" to "<3".

120
00:06:37,319 --> 00:06:41,693
解析器停在最后一个版本 2 的发布版上，导入就正常了
The resolver stops at the last version 2 release, and the imports work.

121
00:06:42,013 --> 00:06:43,784
暂停一下，把两处修复都做好
Pause and make both fixes.

122
00:06:45,316 --> 00:06:46,916
再跑一次第 5 步
Run step 5 again.

123
00:06:47,087 --> 00:06:51,780
将近 7 分钟构建完成，大部分时间在锁定依赖、安装包
It builds in almost 7 minutes, mostly locking and installing packages.

124
00:06:52,100 --> 00:06:56,324
没有密钥，AWS 检查失败了，但 shell 还是打开了
The AWS check fails without keys, but the shell still opens.

125
00:06:56,566 --> 00:06:59,236
进去以后，额外检查显示 Python 3.9
Inside, extras show Python 3.9,

126
00:06:59,236 --> 00:07:05,953
SageMaker 版本 2 和 TensorFlow 2.18，还有脚本里的三个值
SageMaker version 2 and TensorFlow 2.18, and the three values from the script.

127
00:07:06,273 --> 00:07:08,726
弃用警告不是问题所在
Deprecation warnings are not the error.

128
00:07:08,966 --> 00:07:13,680
有一个小疏漏：帮助文本里还写着 GCS bucket 和 Vertex AI
A small slip: the help text still says GCS bucket and Vertex AI,

129
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:15,963
测试参数也不起任何作用
and the test flag does nothing.

130
00:07:16,283 --> 00:07:18,630
命令都是 AWS 的
The commands are the AWS ones.

131
00:07:18,950 --> 00:07:21,169
这个 image 大约 4 GB
The image is about 4 gigabytes.

132
00:07:22,517 --> 00:07:26,328
在准备模型之前，先看课上的一个设计问题
Before we prepare the model, a design question from the lecture:

133
00:07:26,328 --> 00:07:28,234
预处理放在哪里做？
where does preprocessing happen?

134
00:07:28,554 --> 00:07:31,797
在 notebook 里，你一个单元格一个单元格地缩放、归一化
In a notebook, you resize and normalize cell by cell.

135
00:07:32,117 --> 00:07:36,448
生产环境的 endpoint 应该接收原始照片，自己把这些都做完
A production endpoint should take the raw photo and do all of that itself.

136
00:07:37,100 --> 00:07:39,404
在这个教程里，是客户端来做
In this tutorial, the client does it.

137
00:07:39,724 --> 00:07:48,257
预测代码打开照片，转成 RGB，再缩放到 224 乘 224
The predict code opens the photo, converts it to RGB and resizes it to 224 by 224.

138
00:07:48,577 --> 00:07:53,442
然后除以 255，把这些数字作为 JSON 发出去
Then it divides by 255 and sends the numbers as JSON.

139
00:07:53,684 --> 00:07:58,591
一个额外检查读出了模型的前门，TensorFlow 管它叫签名
An extra check reads the model's front door, which TensorFlow calls a signature.

140
00:07:58,911 --> 00:08:03,916
它接收浮点数，形状是任意数量乘 224 乘 224 乘 3
It takes floats, shaped any number by 224 by 224 by 3,

141
00:08:03,916 --> 00:08:06,975
每张照片给出四个数
and gives four numbers per photo.

142
00:08:07,295 --> 00:08:09,982
预处理在这条线上你这一边
Preprocessing sits on your side of the wire.

143
00:08:10,217 --> 00:08:13,396
课上点出了风险：客户端的脆弱性
The lecture names the risk: client-side brittleness.

144
00:08:13,716 --> 00:08:17,188
每个客户端都必须一模一样地重复这些步骤
Every client must repeat those steps exactly,

145
00:08:17,188 --> 00:08:22,590
一个忘了除以 255 的手机应用，会得到一个信心满满的错误答案
and a phone app that forgets to divide by 255 gets confident nonsense.

146
00:08:22,910 --> 00:08:27,348
模型里只放一份，也更容易回滚和做版本管理
One copy inside the model is also easier to roll back and version.

147
00:08:27,584 --> 00:08:30,656
课上的修复在第 2 部分的训练脚本里
The fix from the lecture sits in the part 2 trainer.

148
00:08:30,976 --> 00:08:36,266
预处理函数把 JPEG 解码，转成浮点数，再缩放
The preprocess function decodes the JPEG, converts it to floats, and resizes it.

149
00:08:36,500 --> 00:08:41,110
一个被标成模型前门的函数接收一批 JPEG 字符串
A function marked as the model's front door takes a batch of JPEG strings,

150
00:08:41,110 --> 00:08:43,540
逐个处理，再调用模型
prepares each one, and calls the model.

151
00:08:43,860 --> 00:08:45,972
它被保存为 serving default
It is saved as the serving_default.

152
00:08:46,292 --> 00:08:48,874
输入原始字节，每个类别输出一个分数
Raw bytes in, one score per class out.

153
00:08:49,117 --> 00:08:50,717
有一个坑要避开
One trap to avoid.

154
00:08:50,866 --> 00:08:55,538
README 说 prepare 这一步会把模型转成 SavedModel 格式
The README says the prepare step converts the model to the SavedModel format.

155
00:08:55,858 --> 00:09:00,125
那是格式的变化，不是课上讲的签名的变化
That is a change of format, not the change of signature from the lecture.

156
00:09:01,467 --> 00:09:05,307
第 1 步：python cli.py --prepare
Step 1: python cli.py --prepare.

157
00:09:05,627 --> 00:09:07,312
README 列了四件事
The README lists four things.

158
00:09:07,632 --> 00:09:10,009
从 GitHub 下载模型
Download the model from GitHub,

159
00:09:10,009 --> 00:09:14,688
转成 SavedModel 格式，打包成 model.tar.gz
convert it to the SavedModel format, pack it as model.tar.gz,

160
00:09:14,688 --> 00:09:16,912
再上传到你的 bucket
and upload it to your bucket.

161
00:09:17,232 --> 00:09:20,966
这些是课上部署图里的第 1 步和第 3 步
Those are steps 1 and 3 of the lecture deployment picture.

162
00:09:21,286 --> 00:09:24,656
第 2 步，也就是签名的变化，不在第 1 部分里
Step 2, the signature change, is not in part 1.

163
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:27,222
暂停一下，跑一遍
Pause and run it.

164
00:09:27,272 --> 00:09:29,215
我们的马上就停了
Ours stops right away:

165
00:09:29,215 --> 00:09:34,781
没有凭据，在 cli.py 第 73 行，那一行创建 bucket
no credentials, at line 73 of cli.py, which creates the bucket.

166
00:09:35,101 --> 00:09:39,198
而且 artifacts 目录不存在，所以什么都没下载
And the artifacts folder does not exist, so nothing was downloaded.

167
00:09:39,434 --> 00:09:41,117
README 里有一个小疏漏
A small gap in the README:

168
00:09:41,117 --> 00:09:47,007
代码先创建 bucket，再下载东西，清单里没提这一步
the code creates the bucket before it downloads anything, a step the list does not mention.

169
00:09:47,327 --> 00:09:52,255
有你的密钥时，它会创建 bucket，如果已经存在，就复用你的
With your keys, it creates the bucket, or reuses yours if it already exists.

170
00:09:52,500 --> 00:09:54,825
为了展示接下来的事，做一个额外实验
To show what comes next, an extra:

171
00:09:54,825 --> 00:09:59,817
同一个 prepare 函数，把 S3 换成一个什么都不发送的 stub
the same prepare function, with S3 replaced by a stub that sends nothing.

172
00:10:00,137 --> 00:10:05,087
release 的 zip 包下载下来，模型导出了，而 stub 拦下了上传
The release zip downloads, the model is exported, and the stub stops the upload.

173
00:10:05,407 --> 00:10:07,370
什么都没到达 AWS
Nothing reaches AWS.

174
00:10:07,867 --> 00:10:09,467
来看它生成了什么
Here is what it made.

175
00:10:09,531 --> 00:10:11,370
SavedModel 是一个目录
A SavedModel is a folder:

176
00:10:11,370 --> 00:10:15,417
计算图和有名字的入口，在 saved model 那个 pb 文件里
the graph and its named entry points in saved_model.pb,

177
00:10:15,417 --> 00:10:18,214
权重在 variables 目录里
and the weights in a variables folder.

178
00:10:18,450 --> 00:10:20,953
代码把它放在一个叫 1 的目录里
The code puts it in a folder named 1,

179
00:10:20,953 --> 00:10:25,149
因为 TensorFlow Serving 先按名字、再按版本找模型
because TensorFlow Serving finds models by name, then version.

180
00:10:25,469 --> 00:10:27,858
在 tar 包里，顶层就是这个目录
The tarball holds that folder at its top.

181
00:10:28,900 --> 00:10:31,636
额外跑一个 git status，能看到你的两处改动
An extra git status shows your two edits,

182
00:10:31,636 --> 00:10:34,105
Git 也忽略了 artifacts 目录
and Git ignores the artifacts folder.

183
00:10:34,425 --> 00:10:37,313
在你的账号里，tar 包现在放在 S3 上
In your account, the tarball now sits in S3,

184
00:10:37,313 --> 00:10:39,546
只要它存在，存储就在计费
and storage bills while it exists.

185
00:10:41,883 --> 00:10:43,483
第 2 步：deploy
Step 2: deploy.

186
00:10:43,739 --> 00:10:45,979
还记得开头那三样东西
Remember the three pieces from the start.

187
00:10:46,299 --> 00:10:49,440
在代码里，它先描述一个 TensorFlow 模型
In code, it first describes a TensorFlow model:

188
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:53,382
S3 里的 tar 包、负责推理的 container，再加上角色
the tarball in S3 and the serving container, plus the role.

189
00:10:53,702 --> 00:10:56,048
这时 AWS 里还什么都没有
Nothing exists in AWS yet.

190
00:10:56,283 --> 00:10:58,950
课上在这里把模型上传到模型注册表
The lecture uploads to a model registry here.

191
00:10:59,270 --> 00:11:01,803
两份 README 也都写着模型注册表
Both READMEs say model registry too,

192
00:11:01,803 --> 00:11:05,179
但代码只在 SageMaker 里建了一个普通的模型
but the code creates a plain model in SageMaker.

193
00:11:05,416 --> 00:11:07,952
你不用自己写 image 名
You never write an image name:

194
00:11:07,952 --> 00:11:11,839
SDK 会选出 AWS 的 TensorFlow Serving image
the SDK picks the AWS TensorFlow Serving image

195
00:11:11,839 --> 00:11:14,205
依据是框架版本 2.13
from framework version 2.13.

196
00:11:14,525 --> 00:11:17,981
我们的模型是用 TensorFlow 2.18 导出的
Our model was exported by TensorFlow 2.18.

197
00:11:18,301 --> 00:11:22,611
在第 3 步，一个本地检查会显示 Serving 2.13 能加载它
In step 3, a local check shows that Serving 2.13 loads it.

198
00:11:22,850 --> 00:11:29,762
然后 deploy，实例是一台 ml.m5.xlarge，名字带时间戳
Then deploy, with one instance of type ml.m5.xlarge, under a name with a timestamp.

199
00:11:30,082 --> 00:11:33,786
这一次调用就创建了全部三样：SageMaker 里的模型
That one call creates all three: the model in SageMaker,

200
00:11:33,786 --> 00:11:38,084
一份 endpoint 配置，写明用哪台机器、哪个模型
an endpoint configuration, which names the machine and the model,

201
00:11:38,084 --> 00:11:40,663
还有 endpoint，也就是你要调用的地址
and the endpoint, the address you call.

202
00:11:40,900 --> 00:11:44,697
暂停一下，跑 python cli.py --deploy
Pause and run python cli.py --deploy.

203
00:11:45,017 --> 00:11:50,031
我们的停在第 168 行，也就是 deploy 调用：没有凭据
Ours stops at line 168, the deploy call: no credentials.

204
00:11:50,351 --> 00:11:53,640
用你的密钥，README 说要 5 到 10 分钟
With yours, the README says 5 to 10 minutes,

205
00:11:53,640 --> 00:11:56,033
然后打印出 endpoint 名
then it prints the endpoint name

206
00:11:56,033 --> 00:11:58,798
并保存到 endpoint config 那个 JSON 文件里
and saves it in endpoint_config.json.

207
00:11:59,033 --> 00:12:02,937
课上把这个叫 serverless，意思是不用你管服务器
The lecture calls this serverless, meaning no server for you to manage.

208
00:12:03,257 --> 00:12:07,865
它仍然是一台机器，全天候在计费，哪怕流量是零
It is still one machine, billing around the clock, even with zero traffic.

209
00:12:08,185 --> 00:12:11,562
和第 14 讲的 Cloud Run 不同
Unlike Cloud Run in lecture 14, this endpoint,

210
00:12:11,562 --> 00:12:15,012
照代码这样创建的 endpoint 不会缩容到零
as the code creates it, does not scale to zero.

211
00:12:15,250 --> 00:12:17,383
课上比较了两种部署方式
The lecture compares two ways to serve.

212
00:12:17,703 --> 00:12:21,047
模型 endpoint 直接部署训练好的模型
A model endpoint deploys a trained model directly,

213
00:12:21,047 --> 00:12:24,658
版本管理、A/B 测试和监控都现成可用
with versioning, A/B testing and monitoring available.

214
00:12:24,978 --> 00:12:30,546
Cloud Run 这类通用 container 服务，什么都能跑，其余自己搭
A general container service like Cloud Run runs anything, and you build the rest yourself.

215
00:12:30,783 --> 00:12:34,468
它的经验法则：要部署训练好的模型，就用 endpoint
Its rule of thumb: an endpoint to serve a trained model,

216
00:12:34,468 --> 00:12:38,612
模型只是更大应用的一部分时，用 container 服务
a container service when the model is one part of a larger app.

217
00:12:38,932 --> 00:12:40,895
在这里，这些功能都没用上
Here, those features go unused.

218
00:12:42,233 --> 00:12:45,966
第 3 步：python cli.py --predict
Step 3: python cli.py --predict.

219
00:12:46,286 --> 00:12:48,917
没找到 endpoint config 那个 JSON 文件
Ours finds no endpoint_config.json

220
00:12:48,917 --> 00:12:51,470
我们的就退回到一个默认名字
and falls back to a default name.

221
00:12:51,790 --> 00:12:56,804
它挑了五张照片，失败了五次：Unable to locate credentials
It picks five photos and fails five times: Unable to locate credentials.

222
00:12:57,124 --> 00:12:58,724
暂停一下，跑你的
Pause and run yours.

223
00:12:58,833 --> 00:13:00,753
每次尝试会发送一张照片
Each try would send one photo.

224
00:13:01,073 --> 00:13:07,217
客户端把它缩放到 224 乘 224，有 3 个颜色通道
The client resizes it to 224 by 224, with 3 color channels.

225
00:13:07,537 --> 00:13:10,993
为了这一张照片，有多少个数字要传到 endpoint？
How many numbers travel to the endpoint for that one photo?

226
00:13:19,833 --> 00:13:27,513
224 乘 224 乘 3：150528 个浮点数
224 times 224 times 3: 150,528 floats.

227
00:13:27,833 --> 00:13:32,569
Python 把每一个都写成 JSON 里的文本，所以每张照片有好几 MB
Python writes each one as text in JSON, so a few megabytes per photo.

228
00:13:32,889 --> 00:13:36,409
一个接收字节的签名，会直接发送 JPEG 本身
A signature that takes bytes would send the JPEG itself.

229
00:13:36,650 --> 00:13:39,317
答案是一个包含四个概率的列表
The answer is a list of four probabilities.

230
00:13:39,637 --> 00:13:43,951
代码用 argmax 取最大的那个，再去查表
The code takes the largest with argmax and looks it up:

231
00:13:43,951 --> 00:13:47,167
0 是 parmigiano，1 是 gruyere，2 是 brie，3 是 gouda
0 parmigiano, 1 gruyere, 2 brie, 3 gouda.

232
00:13:47,416 --> 00:13:48,988
为了看到真实的回答
To see a real answer,

233
00:13:48,988 --> 00:13:52,429
我们用一个额外的本地替身，不是 SageMaker
we use an extra local stand-in, not SageMaker.

234
00:13:52,749 --> 00:13:56,420
AWS 的推理 image 里跑的是 TensorFlow Serving
The AWS serving image runs TensorFlow Serving,

235
00:13:56,420 --> 00:14:01,048
所以我们在导出的模型上启动了公开的 Serving 2.13 image
so we started the public Serving 2.13 image on our export.

236
00:14:01,368 --> 00:14:02,968
它加载了版本 1
It loads version 1.

237
00:14:03,100 --> 00:14:06,961
然后同一个预测函数把同样的 JSON 发给它
Then the same predict function sends the same JSON to it.

238
00:14:07,281 --> 00:14:08,892
照片是 brie，回来的就是 brie
Brie comes back brie,

239
00:14:08,892 --> 00:14:11,981
照片是 gruyere，回来的就是 gruyere，每次都是四个数
and gruyere comes back gruyere, four numbers each.

240
00:14:12,031 --> 00:14:15,249
而 parmigiano 回来的是 brie，98%
And parmigiano comes back brie, at 98 percent.

241
00:14:15,569 --> 00:14:18,385
这是发布出来的模型真实犯下的错误
That is a real mistake of the released model.

242
00:14:18,705 --> 00:14:22,864
它自己的指标文件写的准确率大约是 72%
Its own metrics file reports about 72 percent accuracy.

243
00:14:23,100 --> 00:14:24,700
现在回到开头的谜题
Now the opening puzzle.

244
00:14:24,935 --> 00:14:29,685
代码一样，产物不同：README 的输出来自一个更旧的模型
Same code, different artifact: the README output came from an older model,

245
00:14:29,685 --> 00:14:32,444
有三个类别，label 顺序也不一样
with three classes and another label order.

246
00:14:32,764 --> 00:14:37,308
有一个小疏漏：你应该看到四个数，而且索引 0 是 parmigiano
A small gap: expect four numbers, and index 0 is parmigiano.

247
00:14:37,550 --> 00:14:40,046
一条额外的命令删掉了这个替身
An extra command removes the stand-in.

248
00:14:40,366 --> 00:14:42,328
它从没碰过 AWS
It never touched AWS.

249
00:14:43,567 --> 00:14:47,455
课上提醒，endpoint 只要开着就在花钱
The lecture warns that an endpoint costs money while it is up,

250
00:14:47,455 --> 00:14:49,839
课件上就喊了一个词：删除
and the slides shout one word: delete.

251
00:14:50,159 --> 00:14:51,844
README 给了三种方式
The README gives three ways.

252
00:14:52,164 --> 00:14:56,730
哪一种都能停掉 endpoint，但只有第三种还会删掉 tar 包
Any one stops the endpoint, but only the third also removes the tarball.

253
00:14:57,050 --> 00:15:01,466
方式 1，控制台：SageMaker、Endpoints，选中你的，点 Delete
Way 1, the console: SageMaker, Endpoints, select yours, Delete.

254
00:15:01,767 --> 00:15:04,924
方式 2 给了三条 AWS CLI 命令
Way 2 gives three AWS CLI commands.

255
00:15:05,244 --> 00:15:08,820
照着原样输入，第一条就是一个 shell 报错
Typed exactly as written, the first one is a shell error:

256
00:15:08,820 --> 00:15:13,778
尖括号是占位符，shell 把它们当成了重定向
the angle brackets are placeholders, and the shell takes them as a redirection.

257
00:15:14,017 --> 00:15:16,961
有一个小疏漏：输入你自己的名字，不带尖括号
A small gap: type your own names, without brackets.

258
00:15:17,281 --> 00:15:19,777
这样改了以后，我们的还是失败了：没有凭据
Ours then fails: no credentials.

259
00:15:20,097 --> 00:15:24,790
按这个顺序删：先 endpoint，再它的配置，最后是模型
Delete in this order: the endpoint, then its configuration, then the model.

260
00:15:26,567 --> 00:15:27,567
方式 3
Way 3:

261
00:15:27,567 --> 00:15:32,626
python cli.py --delete 停在它的第一个 SageMaker 调用上
python cli.py --delete stops at its first SageMaker call.

262
00:15:32,946 --> 00:15:34,368
暂停一下，跑一遍
Pause and run it.

263
00:15:34,418 --> 00:15:38,279
有密钥时，它删除 JSON 文件里记着的那个 endpoint
With keys, it deletes the endpoint named in the JSON file.

264
00:15:38,599 --> 00:15:45,148
然后按命名约定删掉匹配的配置和模型，最后是 S3 里的 tar 包
Then come matching configurations and the model, by naming convention, then the tarball in S3.

265
00:15:45,384 --> 00:15:49,053
每次 deploy 都会建一个新 endpoint
Each deploy makes a new endpoint with a new timestamp,

266
00:15:49,053 --> 00:15:51,976
时间戳也是新的，可 JSON 文件只记着最后一个名字
but the JSON file keeps only the last name.

267
00:15:52,296 --> 00:15:54,813
你跑了两次 deploy，然后跑了一次 delete
You ran deploy twice, then delete once.

268
00:15:55,133 --> 00:15:56,840
还有几个 endpoint 在计费？
How many endpoints still bill?

269
00:16:03,684 --> 00:16:07,737
一个。这次 delete 只删掉文件里记着的那个 endpoint
One. Delete removes only the endpoint the file names.

270
00:16:08,057 --> 00:16:09,721
更早的那个还在运行
The older one keeps running.

271
00:16:10,041 --> 00:16:14,798
用 aws sagemaker list-endpoints 检查，再到控制台确认
Check with aws sagemaker list-endpoints, and confirm in the console.

272
00:16:15,034 --> 00:16:16,520
这就是第 1 部分
That is part 1.

273
00:16:16,570 --> 00:16:19,791
你手动跑了四条命令，部署了一个模型
You ran four commands by hand to deploy one model.

274
00:16:20,111 --> 00:16:22,735
在这之前，Cheese App 还有四个阶段
The Cheese App has four stages before that.

275
00:16:23,055 --> 00:16:26,170
谁来把它们全部跑完，按正确的顺序，每一次都这样？
Who runs all of them, in the right order, every time?

276
00:16:27,217 --> 00:16:28,404
第 2 部分
Part 2.

277
00:16:28,454 --> 00:16:33,617
课上画出了问题：四个阶段，每个阶段由一个人守着一个终端来跑
The lecture draws the problem: four stages, each run by a person at a terminal.

278
00:16:33,937 --> 00:16:35,772
这些步骤怎么执行？
How do we execute these steps?

279
00:16:36,092 --> 00:16:37,905
这个流程能不能自动化？
And can we automate this flow?

280
00:16:38,150 --> 00:16:40,198
答案是一个编排器
The answer is an orchestrator.

281
00:16:40,518 --> 00:16:44,166
课上用的是 Vertex AI Pipelines，基于 Kubeflow
The lecture uses Vertex AI Pipelines, on Kubeflow.

282
00:16:44,486 --> 00:16:47,239
这个教程用的是 SageMaker Pipelines
This tutorial uses SageMaker Pipelines,

283
00:16:47,239 --> 00:16:50,204
同样是把托管的步骤放进一张图里
the same idea of managed steps in a graph.

284
00:16:50,450 --> 00:16:54,868
工作流管理按顺序运行这些步骤，让每次运行都可重复
Workflow management runs the steps in order, makes a run repeatable,

285
00:16:54,868 --> 00:16:57,597
给每一步分配机器，还把过程展示出来
gives each step its machine, and shows it.

286
00:16:57,917 --> 00:16:59,730
这个 repo 覆盖了这四项
This repo covers those four.

287
00:17:00,050 --> 00:17:02,397
调度要等到第 23 讲
Scheduling waits for lecture 23.

288
00:17:02,717 --> 00:17:05,618
而且它是托管的：不用你自己运维集群
And it is managed: no cluster for you to run.

289
00:17:05,867 --> 00:17:09,366
环境设置，第 1 步：clone ml-workflow-aws
Setup, step 1: clone ml-workflow-aws.

290
00:17:09,686 --> 00:17:11,542
我们的 git clone 又是额外的
Our git clone is extra again.

291
00:17:11,862 --> 00:17:14,922
额外的目录树显示 src 下面有四个目录
An extra tree shows four folders under source:

292
00:17:14,922 --> 00:17:16,918
三个阶段，加上 workflow
three stages and the workflow.

293
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:22,139
第 2 到第 5 步都是控制台操作：SageMaker AI 的快速设置
Steps 2 to 5 are console work: quick setup for SageMaker AI,

294
00:17:22,139 --> 00:17:26,696
再加一个 Unified Studio 域，之后你在那里看 pipeline
and a Unified Studio domain, where you will watch the pipeline.

295
00:17:27,016 --> 00:17:28,666
然后是你的 bucket，和一个用户
Then your bucket,

296
00:17:28,666 --> 00:17:31,859
ml-workflow-user，挂了四个策略
and a user named ml-workflow-user, with four policies.

297
00:17:33,100 --> 00:17:37,559
为命令行创建一个访问密钥，下载 .csv 文件
Create an access key for the command line, and download the .csv file.

298
00:17:37,879 --> 00:17:42,508
快速设置和 Studio 域会留在你的账号里：收尾清理时记得检查
Quick setup and the Studio domain stay in your account: check them when you clean up.

299
00:17:42,750 --> 00:17:45,975
第 6 步和第 7 步：安装 AWS CLI
Steps 6 and 7: install the AWS CLI,

300
00:17:45,975 --> 00:17:51,411
然后 aws configure，把 .csv 里的两个值贴进去
